Ombre Folio enhancements
-----------------------
Luné V0.12 integrates additions from the user's optimized fork
https://github.com/liyanjun921/OmbreBrain-folio at revision
bf6887575fa8e6fa519279be9dc7e5886a29d2ea, originating from
https://github.com/ceshihaox-dotcom/OmbreBrain-folio.
Copyright (c) 2026 P0lar1zzZ (original author), Rin (fork modifications).
The MIT LICENSE remains in that separately installed checkout. Its V2 UI
and average-link family clustering are reused with host compatibility
adaptations. The older Folio server is not run: the existing Ombre 3.6.14
process, tool registry, data stores, letter locks and native ledger remain
authoritative. backend/ombre_folio.py implements the integrated runtime
extensions; the active behavior therefore includes these recorded host
modifications even though the pinned base source files remain unchanged.
